---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { LEGAL } from "../data/legal";

const description =
  "How The Boss Frenchies LV collects, uses, shares, and protects the personal information you provide when you place an order or contact us.";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={description}
  path="/privacy-policy"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>{LEGAL.businessName}</strong> ("we", "us",
    "our") collects, uses, shares, and protects personal information when you visit our
    website, complete our checkout, place an order, or contact us. By using the site or
    submitting an order, you acknowledge the practices described here.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {LEGAL.businessName} is a French Bulldog kennel based in {LEGAL.location}. We offer
    stud services and lock-in reservations. You can reach us at
    <a href={LEGAL.phoneHref}>{LEGAL.phone}</a> or by
    <a href={LEGAL.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    We are responsible for the personal information described in this policy. We do not
    sell personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect the information you provide directly to us, including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Contact details:</strong> full name, email address, and phone number.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Shipping details:</strong> country, street address, apartment or suite,
      city, state or province, and ZIP or postal code.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Order details:</strong> selected product, quantity, unit price, total,
      order reference, estimated required date, and any notes you send us.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Communications:</strong> messages, photos, videos, and documents you share
      with us, including the video proof and veterinary records used to validate the
      pregnancy guarantee described in our Terms &amp; Conditions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Payment information:</strong> the payment method you selected, the amount
      paid, and the reference or confirmation you provide. We do not collect or store
      full card numbers, CVV codes, or banking credentials on this website. Payments made
      through Zelle, Cash App, Apple Pay, PayPal, Venmo, or another provider are handled
      by that provider under its own privacy policy.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    When you use the site, we also collect limited technical information automatically,
    such as your IP address, browser type, device type, approximate location derived from
    your IP address, pages viewed, referring URLs, and interactions with our advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How we use your information</h2>
  <p>We use personal information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Process, confirm, and fulfill your order, including lock-in reservations.</li>
    <li>Schedule the service and coordinate with you about dates and availability.</li>
    <li>Coordinate shipping or transport, including quotes and required documents.</li>
    <li>Match your payment to your order using the order reference.</li>
    <li>Validate and administer the pregnancy guarantee.</li>
    <li>Respond to questions, requests, and support messages.</li>
    <li>Prevent fraud, misuse, and unauthorized transactions.</li>
    <li>Comply with legal, tax, and record-keeping obligations.</li>
    <li>
      Send service updates and, only when you have opted in, occasional marketing
      messages by email, SMS, or WhatsApp.
    </li>
    <li>Measure and improve the performance of our website and advertising.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Legal bases and consent</h2>
  <p>
    Where required by law, we process personal information based on one or more of the
    following: your consent, the performance of a contract with you, compliance with a
    legal obligation, and our legitimate interests in operating and improving our
    business. You may withdraw consent at any time, but withdrawal does not affect
    processing that already occurred or processing based on another legal basis.
  </p>
  <p>
    Marketing communications are optional. The checkout includes a separate, unchecked
    consent box for marketing; agreeing to the Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy
    is required to process an order, but it is not consent to marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>5. How we share information</h2>
  <p>
    We share personal information only as needed to operate our business, including with:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Service providers</strong> that host the website, run our customer
      management and automation workflows, process payments, or provide analytics and
      advertising tools.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Shipping and transport providers</strong> when you arrange delivery of a
      dog or related items.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Professional advisers</strong> such as accountants, lawyers, or insurers,
      when necessary.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Authorities</strong> when required by law, court order, or to protect our
      rights, safety, or property.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Successors</strong> in connection with a merger, sale, or transfer of
      assets, subject to this policy.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do not sell personal information. Third-party providers process information under
    their own terms and privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
  <p>
    We use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies, including the Meta Pixel and Google
    Tag Manager, to measure traffic, understand how visitors use the site, and measure
    advertising performance. These tools may collect device and usage information and may
    set cookies on your browser.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings and manage
    personalized advertising through the controls offered by the relevant platform.
    Blocking cookies may affect some site functionality. We do not use these tools to
    collect payment card details.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Data retention</h2>
  <p>
    We keep order, payment, and guarantee records for as long as needed to provide the
    service and to satisfy legal, tax, accounting, and warranty obligations. As a general
    rule, we retain order and guarantee records for up to three years after the
    transaction, unless a longer period is required or justified by an open claim.
  </p>
  <p>
    Marketing contact information is kept until you opt out or ask us to delete it.
    Technical and analytics data is kept according to the settings of the provider that
    collects it.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Security</h2>
  <p>
    We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational measures to protect
    personal information against unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. No method of
    transmission or storage is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute
    security. Please avoid sending sensitive information such as full card numbers or
    banking passwords through chat or email.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Your rights and choices</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
    <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
    <li>Request deletion of your information, subject to legal retention requirements.</li>
    <li>Object to or restrict certain processing.</li>
    <li>Opt out of marketing communications at any time.</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent.</li>
    <li>Request a copy of your information in a portable format where applicable.</li>
    <li>Not be discriminated against for exercising your privacy rights.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise a right, contact us at <a href={LEGAL.phoneHref}>{LEGAL.phone}</a> or by
    <a href={LEGAL.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>. We
    may need to verify your identity before responding. We will respond within the period
    required by applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Our services are intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal
    information from anyone under 18. If you believe a minor has provided us information,
    contact us and we will delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>11. International transfers</h2>
  <p>
    We operate from the United States, and the providers we use may process information
    in the United States or other countries. If you contact us from another country, your
    information may be transferred to and processed in a jurisdiction with different data
    protection rules than your own.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The current version is posted on
    this page with its effective date. Material changes will be communicated through the
    site or by direct notice when appropriate.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions or requests about this policy can be sent to {LEGAL.businessName},
    {LEGAL.location}, at <a href={LEGAL.phoneHref}>{LEGAL.phone}</a> or by
    <a href={LEGAL.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
